AirScout-RS
===========

AirScout-RS is a Rust port of AirScout, the aircraft scatter prediction
software by DL2ALF.

  Original:  https://github.com/dl2alf/AirScout
  Copyright: Copyright (c) 2020 by DL2ALF (http://www.dl2alf.de)
  License:   GNU General Public License, Version 3.0

The port reimplements the original's logic and behaviour in Rust; it is a
derived work and is distributed under the same license, the GNU General
Public License, Version 3 only (GPL-3.0-only). See the file LICENSE.

The license of the original was confirmed by DL2ALF on 2026-11-23.

Third-party libraries bundled with the original (GMap.NET, OxyPlot,
BouncyCastle, DotNetZip, AeroWizard, NDDE and others, under MIT, CPOL,
Ms-PL and other licenses) are not part of this port; their functionality
is provided by Rust crates under their own licenses.

The web page that AirScout-RS serves (crates/as-web/assets) is a subset
of the AirScout web UI (AirScout/wwwroot, GPL-3.0). It bundles jQuery,
Chart.js, CoreUI (template, core, Chart.js plugin and utils), SimpleBar,
tablesorter (MIT chosen of MIT or GPL-2.0), Leaflet.RotatedMarker,
leaflet-tooltip-layout and ReconnectingWebSocket under the MIT license,
Leaflet under the BSD-2-Clause license, and the CoreUI Icons Free under
CC BY 4.0. The licence texts and the list of files are in
crates/as-web/assets/LICENSES/ (THIRD-PARTY.txt); the web server serves
them under LICENSES/.
